  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The initial velocity of the block to undergo a complete vertical circular motion is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>5</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>R</mi></msqrt></math></p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/bbbbb-11.JPG\" style=\"width: 165px; height: 250px;\" /></p><p>Let us assume that the speed of the block when it is moving in the vertical direction is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math>, then using conservation of mechanical energy we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mfenced><msqrt><mn>5</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>R</mi></msqrt></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn></mstyle></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>R</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>R</mi></msqrt></math></p><p>The tangential and centripetal accelerations of the block are</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mo>&#8595;</mo></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>g</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;</mo><mfenced><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8592;</mo></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>net</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
